<</Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Figure 4, the apply phase of Figure 1 unrolled, in three lanes: the pull request, the agent, the Turf engine. Main, merged, starts round 1: the engine plans; the agent compares with the reviewed plan and approves that exact plan; the engine applies; the agent verifies from inside the apply. A dashed loop returns from apply to plan for rounds 2 and 3, while anything is deferred. A passing verify ends as converged, then the agent's report and label, then production. A failing verify ends as halt, the agent's limited rollback, and a break-fix pull request, with a dotted line back to the pull request where the loop began.)
